FUNCTION HTTPGET(URL)
* mv_package UniData seam — HTTP GET returning the response body.  On MVX
* this is the `http` extension; on UniData it shells out to curl (like the
* rest of the OS seam), so the portable client is unchanged.  GPL-2.0-only.
   TMP = "/tmp/mvpkg_get.tmp"
   EXECUTE '!curl -s "' : URL : '" > ' : TMP
   BODY = ""
   OSREAD BODY FROM TMP ELSE BODY = ""
   EXECUTE '!rm -f ' : TMP
   RETURN BODY
